{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Men.</b> And not women." "<b>Sons of worthlessness.</b> Without a yoke — who have cast off the yoke of the Omnipresent (ibid.)." "<b>Inhabitants of their city.</b> And not inhabitants of another city. From here the Sages said: A seduced city is not designated until men seduce it, and until those who seduce it are from within it (Sanhedrin 111)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:56.188259195Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}